---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="hero section" id="top">
	<div class="container hero-grid">
		<div>
			<p class="section-label">Builder · Open Source · Independent</p>
			<div class="hero-identity">
				<img
					class="hero-avatar"
					src={`${base}avatar.jpg`}
					alt="無為 / Wu Wei"
					width="112"
					height="112"
					decoding="async"
				/>
				<div>
					<h1 class="hero-title">
						<span>無為</span>
						<span class="hero-en">Wu Wei</span>
					</h1>
					<p class="hero-handle">@bianwuwei</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<p class="hero-lead">
				独立开发者 / builder。在 GitHub 上公开交付个人产品与开源项目；对 AI 应用实验保持兴趣，专注把想法做成可用的软件。
			</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a class="button" href="#works">产品与开源</a>
				<a class="button button-ghost" href="https://github.com/bianwuwei" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					GitHub
				</a>
			</div>
			<ul class="hero-meta" aria-label="关键词">
				<li>个人产品</li>
				<li>开源</li>
				<li>独立创业</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<aside class="hero-panel" aria-label="定位卡片">
			<div class="panel-card">
				<p class="panel-kicker">当前方向</p>
				<h2>独立交付，公开学习</h2>
				<p>
					从零开始一条新的独立路径：小步发布、在公开仓库里迭代，把软件真正交到用户手里。
				</p>
				<div class="panel-stats">
					<div>
						<strong>Ship on GitHub</strong>
						<span>代码与产品都在这里</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>Learn in public</strong>
						<span>过程可见，持续改进</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<strong>AI experiments</strong>
						<span>应用层探索，不为企业清单</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</aside>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.hero {
		padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem);
	}

	.hero-grid {
		display: grid;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 900px) {
		.hero-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 3rem;
		}
	}

	.hero-identity {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 1.15rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
	}

	.hero-avatar {
		width: 5.5rem;
		height: 5.5rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		object-fit: cover;
		border: 2px solid rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.45);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.hero-title {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 3.6rem);
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}

	.hero-title > span:first-child {
		color: var(--accent-strong);
	}

	.hero-en {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 0.42em;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-muted) !important;
	}

	.hero-handle {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	.hero-lead {
		margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
		max-width: 36rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 1.08rem;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.hero-meta {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.hero-meta li {
		padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.panel-card {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: calc(var(--radius) + 4px);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		background:
			linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(245, 165, 36, 0.12), transparent 45%),
			var(--bg-elevated);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	}

	.panel-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		color: var(--accent-strong);
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.06em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.panel-card h2 {
		margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
		font-size: 1.45rem;
	}

	.panel-card > p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.panel-stats {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.85rem;
	}

	.panel-stats div {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.15rem;
		padding-top: 0.85rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.panel-stats strong {
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.panel-stats span {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
</style>
